'' pkg/sys: the toolchain's sys/win library, imported. Headers come through TKO_INCLUDE, not -i:
'' an '-i' directory is also a package root.
'' TEST: cli
'' No --allow-unlowered: every statement of sys/win, gdiplus and gui lowers. gui's 25
'' declines ('lpti->cbSize = 64' through TOOLINFOW) went with f74deb39.
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/modules/src/pkgsyswin/main.tiko -o tests/modules/pkgsyswin.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/pkgsyswin.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: TIKO lang
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: FF010203
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
